{"data": [{"author_id": "874971173364346880", "conversation_id": "2120117722230968385", "created_at": "2026-11-11T00:52:57.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120318832694976824"], "id": "2120318832694976824", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@AnthropicAI @AnthropicAI hey can you guys help me? Support won't address my verification issue, its been three weeks since I can not use the product and im soft locked. Trying to reach out here on the socials! Please help 🥲 https://t.co/DX6buW46YR", "url": "https://x.com/degenAdmiral/status/2120318832694976824"}, {"author_id": "2100185148201603073", "conversation_id": "2120117722230968385", "created_at": "2026-11-11T00:46:57.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120317319960470014"], "id": "2120317319960470014", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 0, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@AnthropicAI Please don't block Chinese users.", "url": "https://x.com/JinJingx8/status/2120317319960470014"}, {"author_id": "1828848623968497665", "conversation_id": "2120117722230968385", "created_at": "2026-11-11T00:41:15.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120315888322904300"], "id": "2120315888322904300", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 14, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@AnthropicAI $70–$78 a share, 825M shares, ticker ANT — and a $26B private placement on the side. The wild part is the valuation landing below the $1.5–2T talk from a few weeks ago. The market's pricing AI a bit more honestly now. We're tracking the IPO and the AI race over at", "url": "https://x.com/shshajs85/status/2120315888322904300"}, {"author_id": "1587445822718894086", "conversation_id": "2120117722230968385", "created_at": "2026-11-11T00:30:45.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120313244946477214"], "id": "2120313244946477214", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@AnthropicAI From a chat app to an IPO roadshow in a few years. As a small studio shipping games with Claude every day, the real test is whether the product keeps getting this good once public markets are watching.", "url": "https://x.com/aktumdesing/status/2120313244946477214"}, {"author_id": "952976175374123008", "conversation_id": "2120117722230968385", "created_at": "2026-11-11T00:28:23.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120312646193086806"], "id": "2120312646193086806", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 29, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@AnthropicAI The calendar invite for this roadshow deserves its own project manager.", "url": "https://x.com/OfficialXYO/status/2120312646193086806"}, {"author_id": "1871548368331198464", "conversation_id": "2120117722230968385", "created_at": "2026-11-11T00:26:11.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120312092515537248"], "id": "2120312092515537248", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@AnthropicAI ✌️", "url": "https://x.com/zhuxio224640/status/2120312092515537248"}, {"author_id": "1221764608911798272", "conversation_id": "2120117722230968385", "created_at": "2026-11-11T00:23:14.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120311350719037931"], "id": "2120311350719037931", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 0, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@AnthropicAI 825M shares at $70–78 is roughly $58–64B raised. That would more than double Aramco's IPO record.", "url": "https://x.com/jianye43666769/status/2120311350719037931"}, {"author_id": "263606970", "conversation_id": "2120117722230968385", "created_at": "2026-11-11T00:20:44.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120310722861400333"], "id": "2120310722861400333", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@AnthropicAI The roadshow timing is telling — going public while the compute race is still accelerating means Anthropic will be judged quarter by quarter on both revenue growth and safety commitments. The interesting test isn't the valuation, it's whether public-market pressure changes how", "url": "https://x.com/minimaniwo/status/2120310722861400333"}, {"author_id": "825432286451625985", "conversation_id": "2120117722230968385", "created_at": "2026-11-11T00:09:21.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120307856952176939"], "id": "2120307856952176939", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 3, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@AnthropicAI The roadshow is live. Anthropic is out selling shares in person now, SEC disclaimer and all. A lab whose models write most of its own code is about to let the public buy a piece. The house always cashes its chips eventually.", "url": "https://x.com/yannitesh22/status/2120307856952176939"}, {"author_id": "2047125054824067072", "conversation_id": "2120117722230968385", "created_at": "2026-11-11T00:00:07.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120305533773394167"], "id": "2120305533773394167", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 4, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@AnthropicAI Roadshow week is when the compute bill stops being a blog post and becomes a line item analysts model every quarter.\n\nWhich slide gets the most questions: revenue growth or training spend?", "url": "https://x.com/valeharex/status/2120305533773394167"}, {"author_id": "54072837", "conversation_id": "2120117722230968385", "created_at": "2026-11-10T23:58:57.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2